# Ebook binaries are NEVER committed.
# Measured: each Wikisource EPUB is ~4.35MB, of which ~7.7MB of 8.2MB
# uncompressed is the same embedded FreeSerif font set. Across ~6,900 works
# that is roughly 30GB, against a GitHub limit of ~1-5GB per repo.
# Mirroring is infeasible; this catalog stores metadata and links only.
*.epub
*.mobi
*.pdf
*.azw3
